  <AM_Water_Desired.label>渴望</AM_Water_Desired.label>
  <!-- EN: Water is life, sacred and pure. We must seek it, cherish it, and ensure its abundance in our lives.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Nullifies "Soaking wet" thought. -->
