  <AM_Water_Desired.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>身处水源充足的生态群落中（当前地图的含水地形多于100格）</AM_Water_Desired.comps.0.thoughtStageDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: In a non-watery biome (less than 100 water tiles in the current map) -->
